  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-9\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 9</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>La douzième chambre connaît des contestations relatives aux droits et obligations résultant des lois et règlements visés à l'article 581,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">581, 1°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">581, 4°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">581, 5°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">581, 6°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">581, 7°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">581, 8°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"13°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">581, 13°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>du Code judiciaire pour autant que ces contestations portent sur les cotisations au statut social des travailleurs indépendants, ainsi que des contestations entre les organismes chargés de l'application de ces lois et règlements.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</article>",
